☐ Every mount host and native subject source has complete applicable live
  command coverage.
☐ Shared behavior is repeated only when the mount boundary changes its runtime
  contract.
☐ Unsupported operations fail explicitly without mutation.
☐ Native-screen and registered-overlay ownership boundaries remain intact.
